{"id":"c99615f5fab6afb5","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-productive-properties.md","title":"生产集合的非枚举性与向上保持","display":"thm-productive-properties — 生产集合的非枚举性与向上保持","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-productive-properties","aliases":["20-thm-productive-properties"],"display":"thm-productive-properties — 生产集合的非枚举性与向上保持","chapter":"2","section":"2.4","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 2.4.5","source_printed_pages":[39],"source_pdf_pages":[75],"depends_on":["[[20-df-productive]]","[[20-lem-productive-total-injective]]","[[20-df-mred]]","[[20-thm-smn]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-productive-properties"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-productive-properties</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-productive-properties — 生产集合的非枚举性与向上保持"},{"key":"chapter","html":"2"},{"key":"section","html":"2.4"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 2.4.5"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>39</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>75</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2a17bde12e06e430\" href=\"?note=2a17bde12e06e430\" title=\"20-df-productive\">20-df-productive</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"824c073fd4a6ee10\" href=\"?note=824c073fd4a6ee10\" title=\"20-lem-productive-total-injective\">20-lem-productive-total-injective</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d5dada982b721c80\" href=\"?note=d5dada982b721c80\" title=\"20-df-mred\">20-df-mred</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Productive}(P)\">\\(\\operatorname{Productive}(P)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2a17bde12e06e430\" href=\"?note=2a17bde12e06e430\" title=\"20-df-productive\">20-df-productive</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"824c073fd4a6ee10\" href=\"?note=824c073fd4a6ee10\" title=\"20-lem-productive-total-injective\">20-lem-productive-total-injective</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d5dada982b721c80\" href=\"?note=d5dada982b721c80\" title=\"20-df-mred\">20-df-mred</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}productive\\text{-}properties}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}P\\notin\\mathcal E,\\qquad\\exists V\\in\\mathcal E\\ [V\\subseteq P\\land |V|=\\omega],\\\\ P\\le_m Q\\Longrightarrow\\operatorname{Productive}(Q).\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}productive\\text{-}properties}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}P\\notin\\mathcal E,\\qquad\\exists V\\in\\mathcal E\\ [V\\subseteq P\\land |V|=\\omega],\\\\ P\\le_m Q\\Longrightarrow\\operatorname{Productive}(Q).\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若 P=W_e，生产函数必须给 P\\W_e 中元素，矛盾。取全生产函数 p，从空集索引 n 开始，编译 W_h(e)=W_e∪{p(e)}，依次输出 p(n),p(h(n)),…；每一步新值属于 P 且不重复，故是无限 c.e. 子集。若 P≤mQ 经 f，对 W_e⊆Q 编译 W_g(e)=f⁻¹[W_e]⊆P；f(p(g(e))) 属于 Q 且不在 W_e，因此生产 Q。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 2.4.5；印刷页 39；PDF 第 75 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-productive","status":"resolved","id":"2a17bde12e06e430","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-productive]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-lem-productive-total-injective","status":"resolved","id":"824c073fd4a6ee10","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-lem-productive-total-injective]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-mred","status":"resolved","id":"d5dada982b721c80","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-mred]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-smn","status":"resolved","id":"8ba6597a854c206f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-smn]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-productive","status":"resolved","id":"2a17bde12e06e430","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-productive]]；see [[20-lem-productive-total-injective]]；see [[20-df-mred]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-lem-productive-total-injective","status":"resolved","id":"824c073fd4a6ee10","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-productive]]；see [[20-lem-productive-total-injective]]；see [[20-df-mred]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-mred","status":"resolved","id":"d5dada982b721c80","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-productive]]；see [[20-lem-productive-total-injective]]；see [[20-df-mred]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-smn","status":"resolved","id":"8ba6597a854c206f","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-productive]]；see [[20-lem-productive-total-injective]]；see [[20-df-mred]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Productive}(P)","display":false},{"tex":"Q\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}productive\\text{-}properties}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}P\\notin\\mathcal E,\\qquad\\exists V\\in\\mathcal E\\ [V\\subseteq P\\land |V|=\\omega],\\\\ P\\le_m Q\\Longrightarrow\\operatorname{Productive}(Q).\\end{gathered}","display":true}],"bytes":1547,"backlinks":[{"id":"141324e7d302145d","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-lem-productive-total-injective]]；see [[20-thm-recursion-parameters]]；see [[20-thm-productive-properties]]；see [[20-df-K]]；see [[20-df-one-reduction]]。"},{"id":"f045e001caa19927","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-simple]]；see [[20-df-creative]]；see [[20-df-mcomplete]]；see [[20-thm-rec-re]]；see [[20-thm-productive-properties]]；see [[20-thm-creative-mcomplete]]。"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-76","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-productive-properties]] — 章 2；直接提供者 4 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-76","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-productive-properties]]"}],"outgoing":["2a17bde12e06e430","824c073fd4a6ee10","d5dada982b721c80","8ba6597a854c206f"]}